        },
        {
          "title": "What Happens When Security Lock is Enabled",
          "content": "Upon successful activation of the security feature, access to your Horizon App and Horizon card(s) will be immediately blocked. AutoPay transfers from your savings account will be halted, although payments to your Horizon credit card and Savings Pot will continue to be processed. You will be logged out of active sessions, and a confirmation SMS will be sent to your registered mobile number. A notification will be displayed upon re-accessing the Horizon App indicating that the security lock is in effect."
        },
        {
          "title": "Additional Protection Measures",
          "content": "Horizon Bank protects your accounts with a mandatory {{faq_ed9b5ce2_002}}-hour waiting period after activating your Horizon Key or logging in from a new device during which high-risk activities are restricted. You will receive instant push notifications and email updates for outgoing payments, and round-the-clock customer support is available {{faq_ed9b5ce2_006}}/{{faq_ed9b5ce2_007}}."
